WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 3 — English subtitles (PRIMARY dialogue, language: en)

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.000
"You have a sister… her name is Sara."

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Sara? I never heard that name in my life.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Sara was born two years before you… and lived far from us.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Not because we didn't love her… because we were afraid for her.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Afraid for her from what? From whom?

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Omar… there's something you have to tell me. Now.

7
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Layla… I know. I've known for a long time.

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Dad said no one must know… not even you.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
My sister is alive… and you hid her from me for 30 years?

10
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Forgive me, Layla… I was a coward.

11
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The address… it's written here. The last line.

12
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Ten minutes from here… Sara lives ten minutes from here.
